@title Build mode: first step shows the design's open Issues next to the layout verdict
@area Cabinet
# LSC-01: Build mode said "no open problems" while Issues listed errors and warnings. The first step now
# says "cabinet layout" and carries a banner with the Issues counts and a Show issues button.
open qa/fixtures/door-cutouts.novo
wait 30
click_text Reports
wait 5
click_text "Build mode..."
wait 30
expect "Step 1 of"
expect "Check the plate"
expect "The cabinet layout has no open problems"
shot build-first-step
check_layout
# 7 errors = 2 older ones plus 5 "Duct over duct" crossings (ducts 96..100 cross duct 101 in this fixture)
# from the duct-over-duct check that landed in eae9026 (#1780); the fixture really has those crossings.
expect "The design has 7 errors and 8 warnings in Issues"
expect "Show issues"
click_text "Show issues"
wait 10
shot show-issues
